  "headBody": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Iceland in October</title></head><body>\n<main><h1>Iceland in October</h1><p>Eight days, one rental car, and more rain than the forecast allowed for.</p>\n<div class=\"gallery\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\"><a href=\"/full/1.jpg\"><img src=\"/thumb/1.jpg\" alt=\"Black beach\"></a><figcaption>Black sand at Reynisfjara.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\"><a href=\"/full/2.jpg\"><img src=\"/thumb/2.jpg\" alt=\"Waterfall\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\"><img src=\"/thumb/3.jpg\" alt=\"Lava field\"><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n<figure><img src=\"/i/aurora.jpg\" alt=\"Aurora\"></figure>\n<p>The aurora showed itself once, on the last night, for about ten minutes.</p>\n</main></body></html>\n"
}
